capability child/wait  a started child waited for
  heroes  process.wait
  go      exec.Cmd.Wait, os.Process.Wait, exec.Cmd.ProcessState, os.ProcessState
  rust    Child::wait
  python  Popen.wait, Popen.returncode
  note    the input is closed first, as Rust's; every end is closed after, as Go's, so a read after `wait` fails `closed` and the pattern that fills a pipe while waiting cannot be written by mistake

