  python  Popen.poll
  note    the status is then the child's `state`, and `wait` answers it at once

capability child/terminate  a child asked to end
  heroes  process.terminate
  go      os.Interrupt
  rust    -
  python  Popen.terminate
  note    SIGTERM as Python's; Go's `Interrupt` is SIGINT. On Windows `unsupported`, where Python's documentation says `terminate` is `kill` (unrun here): a request is not an end, and `kill` is the one that ends it there

