capability child/usage  the memory and processor time a running child holds and has spent
  heroes  process.usage_of
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  -
  note    added 2026-11-17 (queue 58); psutil's `Popen` and `Process.memory_info` the yardstick; `os.process_usage` of the child's id while the child is held, refused `invalid` once it was waited for or given up, since its id may name another process then (POSIX keeps an unwaited child's id, Windows a process's id while a handle to it is open)

